WEBVTT

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.460
Come on, Hadlar!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.840
This is the end!

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:41.310
The Hero defeated the Dark Lord.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:46.230
There's no telling
what humans are capable of.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:59.390
Just who do you think you are?!

00:00:59.390 --> 00:01:02.660
Begone! Begone, humans!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:20.590
DAI, THE TINY HERO

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.050
Dai, the Hero is here!
Yippee! Go, go!

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:48.540
Defend the island's peace!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.500
You imbecile!

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.690
Ouch.

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:57.290
What was that for, Grampa Brass?

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:02.230
If you have time to play Hero,
then do your magic training!

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.470
Aww...

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.950
How many years has it been
since I found you?

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:10.980
What kind of Hero
can't even learn a single spell?!

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.150
It's so annoying, Gomechan.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.820
Grampa Brass is the one
who told me about the Hero.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:28.090
There once was a swordman of justice,
called the Hero,

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:31.600
who fought the Dark Lord,
a tormentor of people.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:36.380
<i>The Hero, together with his companions,
defeated the Dark Lord at last!</i>

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.000
<i>But...</i>

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.820
We monsters, who were
under the thrall of the Dark Lord,

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:47.800
were freed from his evil will
and came to live here on Dermline Island.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.490
It's all thanks to the Hero.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:52.640
The Hero sounds amazing!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:59.110
Dai, you're to become a brilliant Mage,
so that you can help the Hero someday!

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.940
Grampa just says that
because he's a Mage...

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:09.240
but I wanna be a Hero.
It sounds the coolest.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.620
You agree don't you, Gomechan?

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.710
I knew you'd get me, Gomechan!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:22.800
Huh?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.510
It's a ship.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.470
Huh?

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:30.720
Whoa!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.810
It's a Hero!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.740
Why's a Hero coming to this island?!

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:36.890
I can't just sit here!

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.860
Wait here, Gomechan!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:46.780
Hup!

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.740
Merman, take me to that boat!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.540
I might just meet a real Hero!

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:02.690
For an island supposedly
infested by monsters, it seems peaceful.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:05.960
Ever since the Dark Lord died,
they've all gone docile.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:10.740
All we do is knock them around
and people worship us as Heroes.

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:13.260
Talk about an easy business.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.850
Indeed. I can't wait to cut loose again.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:23.130
Don't just slaughter them. It's not
an extermination mission this time.

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:28.320
The one-of-a-kind mythical creature,
the Golden Metal Slime.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.590
Does it really exist?

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:31.780
What's that?!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:33.780
A Merman!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.080
There's a child riding it!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:43.880
Wow! It's really you!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.800
You're a Hero, aren't you?

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:59.810
That's right.
The Hero and his noble companions.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.100
Oh wow!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.810
Little boy, who are you?

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.860
I'm Dai!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.630
You're from that island?

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:07.320
Yep!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.920
But isn't that island full of monsters?

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:13.780
It's fine. They're all my friends!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.370
Oh really?

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:17.580
They're your friends?

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:24.060
You want me to call everyone?

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.020
That's right.

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:31.110
We go around protecting innocent monsters
so they aren't bullied by humans.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:35.010
So we want to know
the monsters' situation on this island.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.100
Do it for us, Dai.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.140
Got it!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.980
The assembly whistle? What's going on?

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.820
Little boy, is this all of them?

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:12.480
Yep. Almost.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:16.240
Look, isn't there one like this,
but more pretty?

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:17.570
Hmm...

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:20.060
Oh! You mean Gomechan!

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.310
Gomechan?

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:26.080
It's a nickname! The entire name is
Golden whatchamacallit,

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.940
but that's too difficult.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.270
That's it!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.290
Huh?

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:33.240
We'd really love to meet Gomechan!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:36.990
He's a little shy, so I'll go get him!

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.710
What's wrong, everyone? What is it?

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:46.750
Oh, there's a surviving Lump Shaman.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.230
Who are you?!

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:52.010
Deroline the Hero and his companions.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:53.340
A Hero?!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.890
No, I sense something malicious about you.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.470
Why did you come here?!

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.810
What an obnoxious geezer.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:09.860
Why are you struggling?! It's a Hero!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:11.610
What's that?!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.540
Crack!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.290
S...

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:34.050
Stop it!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.220
Dai, run!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:38.800
Grampa!

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:44.810
Thank you, little boy.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:49.150
Here's a reward for you.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.230
Woosh!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:55.570
Dai!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.160
Let's clean up and get out of here!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.830
Everyone get down!

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:04.950
Boom!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.800
Those scoundrels!

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:19.800
That went well.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.430
We'll have whatever we want now.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:24.560
I can't stop laughing!

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:30.580
Why would a Hero do this?!

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:34.210
Why would a Hero kidnap Gomechan?!

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:39.090
That Hero was a fake!
No Hero would do something like that!

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:40.610
Grampa!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.370
I'm going to go save Gomechan!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:46.870
If you want to fight them, use these.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:48.830
What are these?

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.040
Magic Cylinders.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.190
But I can't use magic.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:58.970
Don't worry. Each Cylinder
can trap one living creature within.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:03.990
Just say "Gulp," and they'll suck in
whoever you point a Cylinder at.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.700
Say "Gush" to release the contents.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:07.810
Hmm.

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:12.420
Come up with a plan
and attack with your friends. Also...

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:17.740
these Gold Cylinders were given to me
by the Dark Lord long ago.

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.460
I was too scared
to find out what they contain.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:22.570
-Gulp?
-Just in case...

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.030
Gush!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.410
-Imbecile! Why...
-Gulp!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.870
Gush!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.540
-...are you...
-Gulp!

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.250
Oh wow!

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.880
Okay! That's Grampa for starters!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.260
And now...

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:43.090
Everyone who can still fight, come on!

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.400
Okay!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.610
GUSH/GULP

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.620
FRIZZ
FIRE-TYPE SPELL

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.410
Deroline, the Hero. Raise your head.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.700
Your Majesty.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:14.020
So, how was Dermline Island?

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:17.880
Was it a dark hive of monsters
as rumors say?

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:24.340
Yes. Evil remnant monsters assaulted us
in an endless stream,

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:28.560
but, together with my companions,
we vanquished them.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:30.450
-Wow!
-Amazing!

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:31.830
A true Hero!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:37.860
During this, we captured a rare monster
of which only one exists.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.070
We offer it to you, King Romos.

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.280
A monster for me?

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.580
Th-This is...!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:53.220
Called the mythical creature,
it is the Golden Metal Slime.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:55.830
Truly a living jewel.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.270
How magnificent!

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:03.010
Well done, Deroline!
You may have the reward you requested!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:08.180
The Romos family symbol of a Hero,
the Crown of Champions!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.810
You are truly a Hero worthy of this!

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.730
-What's that?
-It can't be!

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:26.570
Give back Gomechan!

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.300
Gomechan?

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:32.120
That Golden whatchamacallit!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.310
Get back, King Romos.

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:40.230
He may look innocent,
but he's with those vicious monsters.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:42.610
My friends aren't vicious!

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:46.800
But they can be against people like you!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.390
Let's do this, everyone!

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.720
Gush!

00:13:57.770 --> 00:13:58.480
Gush!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:00.770
Gush!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:03.280
Gush!

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.190
...sucking me in?!

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.740
You don't take a hint! You'll regret this!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.040
Everyone, hang on!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:27.130
How do you like that?!
Attacks from air, land, and sea!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.220
We'll get you!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.480
Frizz!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.860
Stay away!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.250
Masopho, let's put them on ice.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.210
-Woosh!
-Crack!

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:15.470
Now! Let's get those monsters!

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:16.720
Right!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.140
Frizz!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:21.980
Frizz!

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:25.820
Crack!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.290
Boom!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.220
Stupid monsters!

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:41.580
Why you...!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.940
Don't underestimate a Hero!

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:48.210
You're no Hero!
You're a crook who kidnapped my friend!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:50.220
Hmm?

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.130
Shut up!

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:56.350
Dai!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.640
I'm your opponent here.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:04.100
I'll silence you for good!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.700
The Golden Cylinders!

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.240
Use the Golden Cylinders, Dai!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.580
Okay!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:18.990
Gush!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.580
Not one, but several?

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.800
You startled me! They're just Slimes!

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:30.710
Gush!

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:41.560
A d-d-d-...

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.850
A Dragon?!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.400
Woosh!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:55.450
Good going, Dragon! Get that fake Hero!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.340
That's enough!

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:12.590
All right, little boy.
Get that Dragon to back off.

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:13.800
Gomechan!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.510
Otherwise...

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:19.070
Don't!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:20.140
Gulp!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:28.110
Nice going, Zulbon!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.570
Darn it!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.940
It looks like we win.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.040
These were all...

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.080
A King Slime?!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.630
Zulbon!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:57.130
So a King Slime came out in pieces!

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.050
Stay away!

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:01.350
Now!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:03.600
Gulp!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.150
You did it, Dai!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.320
Gomechan!

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.510
Damn monsters!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.040
How dare you!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:24.330
Stop!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.430
They said they
were a Hero and his companions,

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:34.130
but no Hero would try to kill a child
or take hostages!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.380
The King of Romos?

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:38.690
Get back!

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:41.720
Enough. Let us hear out this monster.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:42.760
Well...

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.810
It seems as though my eyes were clouded.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:55.780
How could I let them go to Dermline Island
without realizing they were fakes?

00:18:55.780 --> 00:19:01.410
Dai's acts of violence were out of
his wish to save his friend. Have mercy.

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:05.100
Sir Brass, it is I who should
beg for forgiveness.

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:06.540
Bring it forward.

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:19.510
Perhaps this brave child is the one truly
worthy of wearing this Crown of Champions.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:25.970
I bestow this to the future Hero.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.690
The future Hero...

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:42.360
Now, let us continue on our way
to the Papnica Kingdom.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:45.050
Please! Don't leave us!

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:47.870
Wait!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.000
Where's my Crown of Champions?!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.500
Hmm? Don't ask me.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:57.800
That's my treasure!
Where did you hide it?!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.320
I don't know!

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:04.300
Besides, you have no use for
something for a Hero!

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.990
I'm the future Hero!

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:09.520
Your future is as a Mage!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:13.230
And nothing else!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:17.020
Oh come on, Grampa!

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:21.030
THREE MONTHS LATER

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.030
Frizz!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.970
Pathetic!

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:31.790
Ow!

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:37.190
Grampa, I wanna do Hero training!

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:40.400
You don't need such training!
Let's continue!

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:41.570
Aww...

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:43.340
Huh? It's a ship.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.510
Hm?

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:48.910
Oh! It's a battleship!
A battleship is invading!

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:49.970
What?!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.640
Isn't that a battleship?

00:20:54.810 --> 00:21:00.130
That's the Sacred Ship. A special ship
that only a Sage is allowed to use.

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.280
Huh.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.410
Is that a Sage?

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.020
Get your head down!

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:14.040
Ow!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:21.840
You are Dai, the Future Hero
and Brass, the Venerable?

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:23.530
The Future Hero?!

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:25.130
B-Brass, the Venerable?

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:30.530
I am Bishop Temjin of Papnica Kingdom,
and this is Varon, the Sage.

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:35.140
We have come to this island with
Princess Leona of Papnica on a mission.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.660
The Princess?!

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:37.480
Oh!

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:48.990
Are you Dai, the Hero?

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:50.830
Yep!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:56.290
Oh wow, you're so tiny!
Talk about undependable!

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:38.180
<i>Princess Leona of Papnica Kingdom
arrives at Dermline Island.</i>

00:23:38.180 --> 00:23:44.520
<i>Dai guides her across the island,
but mysterious monsters attack.</i>

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:47.740
<i>Dai and Leona fall into peril.</i>

00:23:48.190 --> 00:23:51.320
<i>Just then,
Dai is enveloped in a mysterious light!</i>

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:55.180
<i>Next time on</i>
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.180 --> 00:23:57.050
<i>"Dai and Princess Leona"</i>

00:23:57.050 --> 00:23:59.330
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
